  description="Learn how Android Mock Location providers, iOS Xcode GPX simulation, and Chrome DevTools Sensors emulate GPS coordinates for software testing and QA."
  h1="How Mock Locations Work: Testing & Spoofing GPS for Developers"
  subtitle="A developer and QA testing walkthrough explaining Android mock location providers, Xcode GPX route simulation, and Chrome DevTools sensor overrides."
